{"version": 2, "width": 80, "height": 24, "timestamp": 1782411881, "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/zsh", "TERM": "tmux-256color"}}
[0.02415, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[J"]
[0.024632, "o", "\u001b[1m  Marketing Page Quality Gate — MCP server\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  Stop paying to send traffic to leaky pages.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[2.098933, "o", "\u001b[36m# We ship AI landing pages at velocity. Who checks them before we spend? Grade one, deterministically.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.632285, "o", "\u001b[1m$ score: leaky_funnel.html\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[5.656694, "o", "  \u001b[1m\u001b[31mF\u001b[0m  (26/100)   \u001b[2mleaky_funnel.html\u001b[0m\r\n    pixels   0  mobile   0  cta   0  speed 100  links  25\r\n    \u001b[33m84% of ad spend at risk\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[5.671348, "o", "\r\n"]
[8.014817, "o", "\u001b[36m# \u001b[31mF.\u001b[0m No viewport, no pixel, no CTA, dead links — and 84% of ad spend at risk.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[10.551163, "o", "\u001b[1m$ score: perfect.html\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.720525, "o", "  \u001b[1m\u001b[32mA\u001b[0m  (100/100)   \u001b[2mperfect.html\u001b[0m\r\n    pixels 100  mobile 100  cta 100  speed 100  links 100\r\n    \u001b[33m0% of ad spend at risk\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.737022, "o", "\r\n"]
[14.087005, "o", "\u001b[36m# \u001b[32mA.\u001b[0m Responsive, tracked, one clear CTA, fast, no broken links. Zero spend at risk.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[16.543428, "o", "\u001b[36m# The point isn't a grade — it's GATING spend. Feed a real Ads Manager CSV export:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[19.057289, "o", "\u001b[1m$ gate_spend: leaky_funnel.html + meta CSV\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[20.192047, "o", "  \u001b[1m\u001b[31mBLOCK\u001b[0m  grade F  on $12,751/mo\r\n    \u001b[31m$10,711 at risk\u001b[0m — Missing tracking pixels blind optimization\r\n"]
[20.209582, "o", "\r\n"]
[22.443558, "o", "\u001b[36m# BLOCKED — $10k+ of real budget would have burned on a broken funnel. That's the job.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[24.867496, "o", "\u001b[36m# Each signal is its own tool. Why is the funnel leaking? Pixels = your biggest dollar leak:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[27.273747, "o", "\u001b[1m$ detect_pixels: leaky_funnel.html\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[28.509967, "o", "  {\"meta_pixel\": false, \"ga4\": false, \"gtm\": false, \"tiktok\": false, \"found\": [], \"count\": 0}\r\n"]
[28.562038, "o", "\r\n"]
[30.846411, "o", "\u001b[36m# No pixel = no measurement, no retargeting — the whole budget runs blind.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[33.34783, "o", "\u001b[36m# Half-A: ad metrics. HONESTLY mocked (mock:true); the CSV reader above is the REAL path.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[35.894074, "o", "\u001b[1m$ get_campaign_metrics: meta\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[37.06399, "o", "  {\r\n  \"platform\": \"meta\",\r\n  \"mock\": true,\r\n  \"note\": \"MOCK DATA \\u2014 plug real meta API keys in connectors.py\",\r\n  \"currency\": \"USD\",\r\n  \"campaigns\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"Meta Prospecting Q2\",\r\n      \"spend\": 12500.0,\r\n      \"impressions\": 850000,\r\n      \"clicks\": 12400,\r\n      \"conversions\": 310,\r\n"]
[37.079252, "o", "\r\n"]
[39.363905, "o", "\u001b[36m# It's a real MCP server — eight tools, callable by any agent in natural language:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[41.899866, "o", "\u001b[1m$ list tools\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[43.241681, "o", "  audit_mobile  audit_speed  check_links  cta_clarity  detect_pixels  gate_spend  get_campaign_metrics  score_page\r\n"]
[43.300605, "o", "\r\n"]
[45.650566, "o", "\u001b[36m# And all of it is gated by a deterministic oracle — 54/54 green.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[48.156221, "o", "\u001b[1m$ uv run pytest -q\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[49.882358, "o", "54 passed in 0.33s\r\n"]
[49.882588, "o", "\r\n"]
[52.220079, "o", "\u001b[1m  Built via the Grok contract-loop. Claude wrote the oracle; Grok built to pass it.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
